    count: exactly 1
    placement: entirely in left half (c0 in 0-5) or right half (c0 in 8-13); r0 in 0-13
    constraint: must not overlap its LR mirror image (guaranteed by half-placement)
  output: 3x3 patch recovered by copying the hole's LR-mirror region and reversing columns

